ous cell without genuine choices.\n\nExact debt interest ranges from 5 to 7. The rounded fixture has infimum 199/40, attained, and supremum 1407/200, unattained. Original strict feasibility precedes closure optimisation. Half-even negative ties, posting minor units, integer gaps, source conflicts, unsupported arithmetic, zero budgets and injected Unknown responses are checked. Incomplete search retains domains, predicates, ordinals and formulas; explored bounds cannot be global certificates.\n\nThe claimed target is the declared rational-linear family. The finite comparisons compute exactly the enumerated assignment sets; algebra supplies the continuous endpoint comparator. This establishes these tested invariants within the profile. It does not establish arbitrary-history completeness. Uncertainty admission checks validate records and declared permissions, not the truth of underlying evidence or professional accounting eligibility. Grouping covers unhedged additive bullet debt with no within-horizon maturity; year fractions are explicit assumptions. Probability atoms are declared disjoint economic hypotheses; their external interpretation is a modeling assumption.\n\n| Decision | Primary criterion | Veto status | Main uncertainty | Next justified action | Not concluded |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| PASS for bounded engineering checks | Independent finite sets, integration and endpoint assertions | protection=True; tests=True; missing=[]; duplicates=[] | shared solver defects, omitted templates, external admission truth | independent result review if PASS; local repair if FAIL | accounting validity, empirical forecast validity, human acceptance or closure of G1–G18 |\n\nEngineering, numerical and interpretation ledgers remain separate: implementation and executed invariants are recorded above; exact results concern only declared constraints; full-company accounting and empirical forecasts remain unevaluated. No stochastic comparison or method ranking is made.\n\nThe strongest alternative explanation is a shared modeling error between construction and fixtures. Independent posting replay, perturbed inputs and analytic endpoint checks reduce that risk. An in-profile counterexample would overturn this result. The weakest evidence is breadth: these are small deterministic cases, not arbitrary accounting histories.\n\nActual command: `python3 -B scripts/check_accounting_p04.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04 --execution-inventory data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/phase-entry-inventory.json`. Python 3.11.15, Z3 4.16.0, CPU only with GPU devices intentionally hidden. Wall time: 3.885472 seconds. Seeds: N/A, deterministic. Git provenance is unavailable; conformance.json contains content hashes and the unchanged 384-file supervisor inventory. Approved plan: `data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/approved-plan.json`. All changed files appear in the manifest.\n\nResiduals: nonlinear inference, continuous probability inference, unbounded integer search, template discovery, general aggregation equivalence, accounting validity, forecast validity and human acceptance remain open. All MC01–MC35/G1–G18 retain wider obligations.\n\ndata/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/progress.md 1360\n# P04 repair checkpoint\n\nThe recovery snapshot matches actual partial files: reconstruction_v1.py,\nrational_solver_v1.py, reconstruction-profile-v1.md and eight unittest methods\nexist. The old checkpoint was stale. Fixture catalog, checker, conformance.json\nand result.md remain missing. All 384 supervisor phase-entry inventory hashes\nmatch. Python 3.11.15 and Z3 4.16.0 are available; execution is CPU only.\n\nThe approved plan and complete structured review were inspected. Skeptical audit:\nparent versus conditional-view separation exists, but numerical correctness and\ncoverage still require executed checks. Independent Fraction enumeration and\nanalytic endpoints remain the comparators. No test count or solver success is a\npromotion criterion for accounting validity. Missing protection evidence or changed\nprotected files veto acceptance; numerical failures trigger local repairs.\n\nChanged files in this repair so far: progress.md. Previous partial contributions:\nscripts/reconstruction_v1.py, scripts/rational_solver_v1.py,\ntests/test_accounting_p04.py, docs/design/spec/reconstruction-profile-v1.md.\nNext checks: execute P04 unittest, repair failures and missing reviewed obligations;\ncomplete versioned fixture catalog and checker; execute P03 regression and P04\nchecker using the supplied phase-entry inventory. Required results remain unfinished.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
